flowchart LR
  R([Edit from<br/>the model]) --> C1[Verbatim quote<br/>from Master Doc?]
  C1 --> C2[Numbers already<br/>in your records?]
  C2 --> C3[Plain text only?<br/>no braces, dashes]
  C3 --> C4[No banned claims<br/>or filler?]
  C4 --> C5[Not a locked<br/>entry?]
  C5 --> OK([Accepted])
  C1 -. fail .-> X[Rejected:<br/>original kept,<br/>listed in Notes]
  C2 -. fail .-> X
  C3 -. fail .-> X
  C4 -. fail .-> X
  C5 -. fail .-> X
  classDef good fill:#e3efe6,stroke:#2f5d50;
  classDef bad fill:#f6e0dc,stroke:#8a3b2e;
  class OK good
  class X bad
